,"source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A friend who I've been estranged with since we graduated from highschool. Cheerful, positive, outgoing, attractive -- she's the type to be popular with both men and women."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A hardhead by nature, she's the type of person to take pride in her work and equally the people who endure it with her. Her nature compels to speak out against injustice and the nonsensical even if it rubs others the wrong way. As you can imagine, that nature doesn't lead her to her popularity in her professional life and gives her no shortage of headaches of not being able to compromise and hold down a job."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In highschool, I was the only one she could talk to frankly without holding back her thoughts whatsoever."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Flattery won't get you anywhere. I can see through it all.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c95109"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"高校を卒業して疎遠になっていた女友達。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ポジティブで明るくルックスも良いため男女問わずウケが良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周りに気を遣って自分が我慢する性格だが、高校時代は主人公にだけは本音を口に出しており心を許していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"筋の通らないことは黙っていられず、衝突が多いので仕事が続かないのが悩み。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23118","sourceWorkId":"30490","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bdb312b48dd92bfb22b3f83d6f311fc8ab125613a1bb3b6472306b3ef73611c8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/65d567f3c7379a57314ff5654728fef2cd4190787f58628a8d076636ec27d166.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"葵 時緒","creatorId":"vndb:s1658","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1658","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1658","name":"葵時緒","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:86506","source":"vndb"}]},{"